## Feature pack page overlays

Only when the pack is enabled. Add these lines inside the matching page block; do
not create a second inventory.

### `woocommerce`

- [ ] `/products`, `/products/[slug]`: ISR (`revalidate: 300`,
      `tags: ['products']`), inline `SimpleProduct`/`VariableProduct` fragments,
      price HTML-entity decoding, `Product` JSON-LD, `generateStaticParams()`.
- [ ] `/cart`: empty and populated states; `woocommerce-session` forwarded on every
      mutation; adding then re-querying retains the item.
- [ ] `/login`, `/register`, `/account`: auth reads scoped to these subtrees (never
      the root layout); expired JWT is cleared; missing session redirects instead
      of rendering account data.
- [ ] Checkout handoff: absolute WordPress URLs with trailing slashes rendered as
      plain `<a>` tags (no SPA interception).

